/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# What `matchesGoldenFile` writes when a comparison fails: four throwaway
# PNGs per case (master/test/masked/isolated diff). Useful for the minute
# you spend looking at a diff, worthless afterwards -- and regenerated on
# the next failure. The screenshots themselves (test/golden/images/) are
# committed on purpose; only this scratch output is not.
/test/golden/failures/
